  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Health in Bangladesh &#x2013; Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To review, monitor, evaluate and learn through specific studies, research and assessments. Key activities carried out so far: assessment of political economy of the health sector of Bangladesh, value for money of better health in Bangladesh programme interventions and Covid-19 research. No further activities are being planned under this component.</narrative>
  </description>
